  ["When to show"] = "何时显示",
  ["When your boss mod warns of AoE damage, show Power Word: Radiance, then Shield, until enough Atonements are up."] = "当首领插件预警群体伤害时，显示真言术：耀，然后真言术：盾，直到救赎足够。",
