  ["Whisper"] = "密语",
  ["With \"Bosses and big pulls\": this many enemies or more counts as a big pull."] = "选择“首领和大波怪”时：敌人达到此数量即视为大波怪。",
  ["With DBM, BigWigs or LittleWigs, a defensive is shown a few seconds before a big hit they warn about (lighter ones first; on cooldown, the next). Also when you are low. Integrations has buttons to test both."] = "装有 DBM、BigWigs 或 LittleWigs 时，会在它们预警的大伤害前几秒显示减伤技能（先轻后重；冷却中则下一个）。血量低时也会。插件联动页面有测试两者的按钮。",
  ["With a controller (the game's gamepad support), keybinds show as controller buttons, for example LT+A."] = "使用手柄（游戏的手柄支持）时，按键显示为手柄按钮，例如 LT+A。",
  ["Xbox (A B X Y, LB RB)"] = "Xbox（A B X Y，LB RB）",
