  ["You know enough of this spec's spells now: DMGAssist's priority list leads."] = "你现在已掌握足够多此专精的技能：由 DMGAssist 的优先级列表主导。",
  ["Your choices"] = "你的选择",
  ["Spec default"] = "专精的切换点",
  ["Your spec's switch point comes from its SimC list (when it uses an AoE list): the count where it changes."] = "专精的切换点来自其 SimC 列表（当它使用群体列表时）：即它切换时的目标数。",
