  ["|cffffd100Step 2.|r Click the box below and press |cffffffffCtrl+C|r. Your words above are included."] = "|cffffd100第 2 步。|r 点击下方的框并按 |cffffffffCtrl+C|r。上面你写的内容也会一起复制。",
