  ["Download (CurseForge)"] = "下载（CurseForge）",
  ["Below max level, and for a new character's starter spec, Blizzard's Assisted Combat leads while you know few of the spells the priority list expects; DMGAssist's list takes over by itself as you learn more. New spells without a key and unspent talent points get one chat line. Combat > Leveling."] = "在满级之前，以及新角色的初始专精，只要你只会优先级列表所需技能中的一小部分，就由暴雪的辅助战斗主导；随着你学会更多，DMGAssist 的列表会自动接手。没有按键的新技能和未分配的天赋点会在聊天框提示一行。战斗 > 升级。",
  ["Fits your UI"] = "融入你的界面",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Titan Panel and ElvUI data texts get a DMGAssist launcher. Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的编辑模式中移动 HUD。Masque 可美化图标。使用手柄时，按键显示为手柄按钮（显示 > 手柄按键名称）。Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 信息文字会有 DMGAssist 启动器。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist is off for %s. /dmga spec on turns it back on."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 关闭。/dmga spec on 可重新开启。",
  ["DMGAssist is on for %s."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 开启。",
  ["DMGAssist on or off for the spec you are in (an alt's healing spec, for example)"] = "为当前专精开启或关闭 DMGAssist（例如小号的治疗专精）",
  ["Like your action bars: an icon turns red when your target is out of that spell's range, and slot 1 turns blue when you are short of resource for it."] = "和动作条一样：目标超出该技能射程时图标变红；资源不足时第 1 格变蓝。",
  ["Use DMGAssist on this spec"] = "在此专精使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Out of range and resource colors"] = "射程和资源颜色",
  ["list recommended spells that have no keybind"] = "列出可推荐但没有绑定按键的技能",
  ["test the defensive alert (8 seconds)"] = "模拟首领插件要求减伤（8 秒），检查是否显示",
  ["refresh keybinds"] = "刷新按键",
  ["report an issue or give feedback: describe it, copy the report, open the issue page"] = "报告问题或提出反馈：描述问题、复制报告、打开 issue 页面",
  ["save a full decision trace for troubleshooting"] = "保存完整的决策记录用于排查问题",
  ["test the interrupt alert, Assisted Combat, or boss mod detection"] = "测试打断、暴雪助手和首领插件检测",
  ["the three setup questions again (where, how big, when to show)"] = "再次回答三个设置问题（位置、大小、何时显示）",
  ["Use DMGAssist on %s"] = "在%s使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Reload the interface now to switch the language?"] = "现在重新加载界面以切换语言？",
  ["Reload now"] = "立即重载",
  ["Later"] = "稍后",
  ["Learned timing"] = "已学习的计时",
  ["Forget learned timing"] = "清除已学习的计时",
  ["DMGAssist learns how long your cooldowns really take, including talents, gear and haste it can't see, and which spells to leave to Blizzard's assistant. It's saved for your whole account and gets better as you play. Forget it to start over, for example after a big talent or gear change. Your settings are kept."] = "DMGAssist 会学习你的冷却实际需要多长时间（包括它看不到的天赋、装备和急速），以及哪些法术交给暴雪的辅助战斗来判断。数据保存在整个账号中，玩得越多越准确。想重新开始时可以清除，例如大幅更换天赋或装备之后。你的设置会保留。",
  ["Learned cooldown timing forgotten. DMGAssist learns again from your next fight."] = "已清除学习到的冷却计时。DMGAssist 将从下一场战斗开始重新学习。",
  ["Not in combat: try again after the fight."] = "战斗中无法操作：请在战斗结束后重试。",
  ["forget learned cooldown timing and start learning again"] = "清除学习到的冷却计时并重新学习",
  ["Slot 1 changes"] = "第1格切换",
  ["Steady (recommended)"] = "稳定（推荐）",
  ["Fast"] = "快速",
  ["Steady: once you're about to press, slot 1 stays put; a spell that becomes ready at that moment shows in slot 2 and moves up after your press. Fast: slot 1 follows every change sooner, for players who react quickly."] = "稳定：在你即将按键时，第1格保持不变；此刻刚好就绪的法术显示在第2格，按键后再上移。快速：第1格更早跟随每次变化，适合反应快的玩家。",
  ["A dark edge around the letters keeps them readable on bright icons."] = "文字周围的深色描边让它们在明亮的图标上也清晰可读。",
  ["A dark panel behind the icons."] = "图标后面的深色底板。",
  ["A glow around slot 1. Only slot 1 moves, so it always draws your eye first."] = "第1格周围的光效。只有第1格会动，所以它总是最先吸引你的目光。",
  ["A line around the frame."] = "框体周围的线条。",
  ["A pick DMGAssist isn't sure about (the game hides a value it needs) is shown slightly faded."] = "DMGAssist 不确定的选择（游戏隐藏了所需的数值）会以略淡的样子显示。",
  ["A small gold-edged icon on slot 1 for an on-use trinket or a potion, when it's time to use it. Quieter than the red one: worth pressing, never urgent."] = "第1格上的金色边框小图标，用于该使用的主动饰品或药水。比红色的低调：值得按，但从不紧急。",
  ["A small red-edged icon on slot 1 for everything that keeps you alive, for every class: defensive cooldowns, self-heals, tank mitigation like Ironfur. It pulses while you need it now."] = "第1格上的红色边框小图标，用于所有职业保命的一切：防御冷却、自我治疗、坦克减伤（如铁鬃）。需要立即使用时会闪动。",
  ["A sound for each kind of alert, so you hear it even when you're not looking. Choose None to silence one."] = "每种提醒都有一个声音，即使没在看也能听到。选择“无”可将其静音。",
  ["A thin bar under slot 1 that empties with your global cooldown."] = "第1格下方随公共冷却减少的细条。",
  ["Action bars and keybinds"] = "动作条和按键",
  ["Alerts and effects"] = "提醒和效果",
  ["All DMGAssist sounds on or off."] = "开启或关闭 DMGAssist 的所有声音。",
  ["Answer the first-time questions again, bind keys, or start over."] = "重新回答首次设置的问题、绑定按键或从头开始。",
  ["Before big hits and when your health is low, a defensive cooldown appears in the red-edged defensive icon on slot 1, pulsing."] = "在大伤害之前以及血量低时，防御技能会出现在第1格的红色边框防御图标中并闪动。",
  ["Blizzard's Assisted Combat"] = "暴雪的辅助战斗",
  ["DBM, BigWigs and LittleWigs warn about upcoming hits, adds and casts, so defensives and interrupts come on time."] = "DBM、BigWigs 和 LittleWigs 会预警即将到来的伤害、小怪和施法，让防御和打断及时出现。",
  ["Defensive icon (staying alive)"] = "防御图标（保命）",
  ["Discipline Priest: Atonement"] = "戒律牧师：救赎",
  ["Extra space between slot 1 and slot 2, so slot 1 stands apart and its small icons have room."] = "第1格和第2格之间的额外间距，让第1格更突出，其小图标也有空间。",
  ["For characters below max level, or with talents far from the usual build."] = "适用于未满级或天赋与常见构筑相差很大的角色。",
  ["For tanks: how many stacks of your mitigation buff are up (Guardian Druid: Ironfur), counted from your casts."] = "坦克用：你的减伤增益有多少层（守护德鲁伊：铁鬃），根据你的施法计数。",
  ["Frame and title"] = "框体和标题",
  ["Getting started"] = "开始使用",
  ["Healing spells in your own kit, for damage dealers and tanks (not healer rotations)."] = "你自身技能中的治疗法术，适用于输出和坦克（不是治疗循环）。",
  ["Hide the icons outside combat (they still show with an enemy targeted, if the next option is on)."] = "脱战时隐藏图标（若开启下一选项，选中敌人时仍会显示）。",
  ["Hide the icons when you don't need them."] = "不需要时隐藏图标。",
  ["Hide the icons while you're in a vehicle (one with its own action bar)."] = "在载具（带有自己动作条的）中时隐藏图标。",
  ["How DMGAssist decides between the single-target and the multi-target rotation."] = "DMGAssist 如何在单体循环和多目标循环之间选择。",
  ["How big the icons are and the space between them. To move them, unlock on the first page and drag, or use Blizzard's Edit Mode."] = "图标的大小和间距。要移动它们，请在第一页解锁后拖动，或使用暴雪的编辑模式。",
  ["How dark the background panel is."] = "背景底板的深浅。",
  ["How many icons: slot 1 is the spell to press now, slots 2 and 3 are what comes after it."] = "显示几个图标：第1格是现在要按的法术，第2、3格是之后的。",
  ["How many spells are shown, and which kinds of spells DMGAssist may suggest."] = "显示多少个法术，以及 DMGAssist 可以推荐哪些类型的法术。",
  ["How solid slots 2 and 3 are. A little lower keeps your eye on slot 1."] = "第2、3格的不透明度。稍低一点能让视线停在第1格。",
  ["How solid the whole HUD is: lower lets you see through it."] = "整个界面的不透明度：越低越能看穿。",
  ["How the icons tell you when to press, and what needs your attention most."] = "图标如何提示你何时按键，以及什么最需要你注意。",
  ["How visible that line is."] = "该线条的可见程度。",
  ["In combat the game hides some values from addons (combo points, for example). How to handle them."] = "战斗中游戏会对插件隐藏一些数值（例如连击点）。如何处理它们。",
  ["In combat, at or below this much health a defensive is suggested."] = "战斗中，生命值低于或等于此值时会推荐防御技能。",
  ["Items icon (trinkets and potions)"] = "物品图标（饰品和药水）",
  ["Its size, as a percentage of slot 1. Larger also covers more of slot 1: move it out with the sliders below."] = "大小，为第1格的百分比。越大也会遮住更多第1格：用下面的滑块把它移开。",
  ["Keybinds and spell names"] = "按键和法术名称",
  ["Move down / up"] = "向下 / 向上移动",
  ["Move left / right"] = "向左 / 向右移动",
  ["NOW above slot 1 and NEXT above slots 2 and 3."] = "第1格上方显示“现在”，第2、3格上方显示“下一个”。",
  ["Nudges it down (below 0) or up (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向下（小于0）或向上（大于0）移动，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Nudges it left (below 0) or right (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向左（小于0）或向右（大于0）移动，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Only for Discipline Priests: spread Atonement before big group damage."] = "仅限戒律牧师：在大范围团队伤害前铺开救赎。",
  ["Optional lines and decoration around the icons."] = "图标周围可选的线条和装饰。",
  ["Out of combat, hide the icons while you're mounted."] = "脱战时骑乘坐骑会隐藏图标。",
  ["Position"] = "位置",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Right-click the box to remove it."] = "药水：%s。当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大冷却）显示在物品图标中。右键点击方框可移除。",
  ["Potion: drag a potion from your bags onto this box to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "药水：把背包里的药水拖到这个方框，即可加入你的循环（仅限此专精）。当 SimC 使用药水时会显示在物品图标中。",
  ["Profiles"] = "配置文件",
  ["Settings can be shared by all your characters (Default) or kept for this character only."] = "设置可以由所有角色共享（默认），也可以只为此角色保存。",
  ["Setup and reset"] = "设置和重置",
  ["Show a defensive cooldown (Barkskin, Shield Wall, Survival of the Fittest...) in the defensive icon when you need one."] = "需要时在防御图标中显示防御技能（树皮术、盾墙、适者生存……）。",
  ["Show the key that casts each spell on its icon."] = "在每个图标上显示施放该法术的按键。",
  ["Show the spells to press. Off hides the icons completely (the key binding and /dmga on | off do the same)."] = "显示要按的法术。关闭则完全隐藏图标（按键绑定和 /dmga on | off 也一样）。",
  ["Show your interrupt (Kick, Pummel, Wind Shear...) in slot 1 when your target casts something interruptible."] = "目标施放可打断的法术时，在第1格显示你的打断技能（脚踢、拳击、风剪……）。",
  ["Show your on-use trinkets when they are ready, in combat, at the moments SimC uses them (with your cooldowns)."] = "在战斗中、SimC 使用它们的时刻（配合你的冷却）显示已就绪的主动饰品。",
  ["Shows, for 8 seconds, the defensive DMGAssist would suggest before a big hit, in the defensive icon."] = "在防御图标中显示8秒钟：大伤害前 DMGAssist 会推荐的防御技能。",
  ["Single target or AoE"] = "单体或群体",
  ["Size"] = "大小",
  ["Size and spacing"] = "大小和间距",
  ["Some cooldowns are saved or spent depending on how long the fight is expected to last."] = "一些冷却会根据预计的战斗时长保留或使用。",
  ["Space after the main icon"] = "主图标后的间距",
  ["Stack counter"] = "层数计数",
  ["The color of the key text."] = "按键文字的颜色。",
  ["The color of the spell names."] = "法术名称的颜色。",
  ["The font for keybinds, spell names and labels on the icons."] = "图标上按键、法术名称和标签使用的字体。",
  ["The game's own rotation helper. DMGAssist asks it about things the game hides from addons."] = "游戏自带的循环助手。DMGAssist 会向它询问游戏对插件隐藏的信息。",
  ["The size of everything at once, icons and text."] = "所有内容的大小，包括图标和文字。",
  ["The size of slot 1, the spell to press now."] = "第1格（现在要按的法术）的大小。",
  ["The size of slots 2 and 3, what comes next."] = "第2、3格（接下来的）的大小。",
  ["The size of the callout text."] = "提示文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the key text."] = "按键文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the spell names."] = "法术名称的大小。",
  ["The size of the stack number."] = "层数数字的大小。",
  ["The sound played for this alert."] = "此提醒播放的声音。",
  ["The space between each icon."] = "每个图标之间的间距。",
  ["The space between the icons and the frame's edge (visible with a background or border)."] = "图标与框体边缘的间距（有背景或边框时可见）。",
  ["The spell's name under each icon."] = "每个图标下方的法术名称。",
  ["The text on and under the icons."] = "图标上和下方的文字。",
  ["Tools for finding out why DMGAssist picked something, and for reporting a problem."] = "用于查明 DMGAssist 为何做出某个选择以及报告问题的工具。",
  ["Trinkets you activate yourself. A ready one appears in the gold-edged items icon on slot 1 (bottom-left by default); press it alongside slot 1."] = "你自己激活的饰品。就绪时出现在第1格的金色边框物品图标中（默认左下）；与第1格一起按。",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. Everything else is on the pages below: Combat (what it recommends), Display (how it looks), Sounds, Integrations, Advanced."] = "开启或关闭 DMGAssist、移动它并选择语言。其他内容都在下面的页面：战斗（推荐什么）、显示（外观）、声音、整合、高级。",
  ["Used when \"Fight length\" is Custom: the fight length assumed, in seconds."] = "当“战斗时长”为自定义时使用：假定的战斗时长（秒）。",
  ["What to recommend"] = "推荐内容",
  ["When the icons show"] = "何时显示图标",
  ["Where DMGAssist finds the key for each spell: Blizzard's bars, Bartender, ElvUI, Dominos."] = "DMGAssist 从哪里获取每个法术的按键：暴雪动作条、Bartender、ElvUI、Dominos。",
  ["Where the key text sits on the icon."] = "按键文字在图标上的位置。",
  ["Where the stack number sits."] = "层数数字的位置。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Bottom-left by default."] = "位于第1格的哪个位置。默认左下。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Top-left by default."] = "位于第1格的哪个位置。默认左上。",
  ["Your interrupt takes slot 1 when an enemy casts something worth stopping."] = "敌人施放值得打断的法术时，你的打断技能会占据第1格。",
  ["Top-left corner"] = "左上角",
  ["Bottom-left corner"] = "左下角",
  ["Bottom-right corner"] = "右下角",
  ["Settings open as soon as the game allows it (after combat)."] = "游戏允许后（战斗结束后）将立即打开设置。",
  ["No potions in your bags"] = "背包里没有药水",
  ["Potion for this spec"] = "此专精的药水",
  ["Potion removed for this spec."] = "已移除此专精的药水。",
  ["Potion set for this spec: %s."] = "此专精的药水：%s。",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Click the box to change it, right-click to remove it."] = "药水：%s。当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大冷却）显示在物品图标中。点击方框可更换，右键可移除。",
  ["Potion: click this box and pick one of the potions in your bags to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "药水：点击这个方框，从背包里的药水中选择一个加入你的循环（仅限此专精）。当 SimC 使用药水时会显示在物品图标中。",
  ["Type /dmga potion and shift-click a potion to choose it."] = "输入 /dmga potion 并按住 Shift 点击药水即可选择。",
  ["choose the potion for this spec (shift-click it), or /dmga potion off"] = "选择此专精的药水（按住 Shift 点击），或 /dmga potion off",
  ["Addons DMGAssist works with:"] = "DMGAssist 可配合使用的插件：",
  ["Check"] = "检查",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, ElvUI, Bartender and Dominos bars give the keybinds, Titan Panel and ElvUI get a launcher, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安装后 DMGAssist 会自动配合这些插件，无需设置：Masque 为图标换肤，ElvUI、Bartender 和 Dominos 的动作条提供按键，Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 获得启动按钮，WeakAuras 可以读取推荐。",
  ["Lists in chat each supported addon: in use, found, or not installed (also /dmga addons)."] = "在聊天中列出每个支持的插件：使用中、已找到或未安装（也可用 /dmga addons）。",
  ["Other addons"] = "其他插件",
  ["Other addons in use"] = "正在使用的其他插件",
  ["Preview. Back in its place when you close the settings."] = "预览。关闭设置后会回到原位。",
  ["Which addons are in use"] = "哪些插件正在使用",
  ["icon skins"] = "图标皮肤",
  ["keybinds read from its bars"] = "从其动作条读取按键",
  ["keybinds from its bars, data text launcher"] = "从其动作条读取按键，信息文字启动按钮",
  ["launcher in Titan Panel"] = "Titan Panel 中的启动按钮",
  ["boss mod warnings"] = "首领插件警报",
  ["can read DMGAssist's picks (DMGAssistAPI)"] = "可以读取 DMGAssist 的推荐（DMGAssistAPI）",
  ["in use"] = "使用中",
  ["found"] = "已找到",
  ["which supported addons (Masque, ElvUI, Bartender, boss mods...) are found and in use"] = "哪些支持的插件（Masque、ElvUI、Bartender、首领插件……）已找到并在使用",
  ["Written and maintained by %s"] = "作者与维护者：%s",
  ["linked"] = "已关联",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的编辑模式中移动 HUD。Masque 可美化图标。使用手柄时，按键显示为手柄按钮（显示 > 手柄按键名称）。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, boss mods time defensives and interrupts, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安装后 DMGAssist 会自动配合这些插件，无需设置：Masque 为图标换肤，首领插件为防御和打断提供时机，WeakAuras 可以读取推荐。",
  ["Accuracy"] = "准确度",
  ["After each real fight, a grade from S+ to D pops up above the icons, with four parts: accuracy, always casting, reaction and cooldowns."] = "每场真实战斗结束后，图标上方会弹出 S+ 到 D 的评级，包含四项：准确度、持续施法、反应速度和冷却使用。",
  ["Always casting"] = "持续施法",
  ["Average of the last %d"] = "最近 %d 场平均",
  ["Best"] = "最佳",
  ["Best grade, trend and where to improve for the spec you are in: see Grade report below Performance grade."] = "当前专精的最佳评级、趋势和改进方向：见“表现评级”下的“评级报告”。",
  ["Clears the best grade and history of the spec you are in. Other specs keep theirs."] = "清除当前专精的最佳评级和记录。其他专精保留各自的记录。",
  ["Cooldowns"] = "冷却使用",
  ["Drag the grade where you want it while the icons are unlocked or in Edit Mode; a sample shows while you do."] = "在图标解锁或编辑模式下，把评级拖到你想要的位置；拖动时会显示示例。",
  ["End-of-fight grade"] = "战斗结束评级",
  ["Fight grade"] = "战斗评级",
  ["Fights shorter than this aren't graded, so trash pulls and a quick hit on a critter don't count."] = "短于此时长的战斗不评级，清小怪或随手打一下小动物都不算。",
